# Build context exclusions for the tyre-web image (context = repo root).
# Keep host (Windows) artifacts out of the Linux build context: faster uploads
# and no native-binary contamination (Prisma engines, *.node, etc.).

# Node
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/build
**/.eslintcache
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Python
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# VCS / editor / OS
.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea
**/.vscode

# Local env & secrets (compose injects env via env_file at runtime)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Logs & misc
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/.cache
